<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<%- include('./partials/head.ejs') %> 

<body>

<%- include('./partials/nav.ejs') %> 

<%- include('./partials/slides.ejs') %>

<style>
.material-tooltip,
.material-tooltip .backdrop {
    background-color: #00695c !important; 
}

.material-tooltip {
    color: #fff !important;
}
</style>

<div class="container-indx center-align">

  <div class="container">
    <h6 style="padding-bottom: 25px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;">
      <span class="soon teal-text text-darken-2">
        Your Choice for Local Professional Cleaning Services!
      </span>
    </h6>
  </div>

  <div id="panel" class="section scrollspy" style="padding-top: 20px;">

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col s12 m8 offset-m2 l4 offset-l3">
        <div class="card-panel teal teal-text text-darken-2">
          <span class="white-text">
            Our experienced cleaning professionals provide dependable residential and commercial services.
            We focus on quality results, attention to detail, and customer satisfaction...
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row center">
      <div class="col s12 m10 offset-m1 l8 offset-l2">
        <p class="center-align" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; font-style: oblique; font-weight: 600 !important;">
           Our team is committed to delivering reliable cleaning solutions tailored to your needs. Whether you require routine maintenance, deep cleaning, or specialized services, we take pride in creating fresh, spotless environments. Every project is completed with care, professionalism, and attention to detail. We use proven cleaning methods and quality products to ensure outstanding results while maintaining a safe and healthy space for your family, employees, or customers.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col s12 m8 offset-m2 l4 offset-l5">
        <div class="card-panel teal teal-text text-darken-2">
          <span class="white-text">
            From homes and offices to retail spaces, we deliver professional cleaning services.
            Our goal is to leave every space refreshed, sanitized, and welcoming...
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col s12 m10 offset-m1 l8 offset-l2">
        <p class="center-align" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; font-style: oblique; font-weight: 600 !important;">
           We understand that every property has unique cleaning requirements. That's why we work closely with clients to provide dependable service plans that fit their schedule and budget. Our trained staff arrives prepared, works efficiently, and maintains high standards from start to finish. Whether it's a one-time visit or recurring service, we're dedicated to helping you maintain a clean, comfortable, and professional environment year-round.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row center-align">
      <div class="col s12 m4" style="font-weight: bold !important; text-decoration: underline;">
        <p>Certified Cleaning Service</p>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-check-to-slot fa-2x tooltipped" style="color: #3CB371;" data-position="bottom" data-tooltip="Licensed, trained, and dependable cleaning professionals."></i>
        <p class="narrow-paragraph">Our trained professionals follow industry standards to provide dependable and consistent cleaning services.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col s12 m4" style="font-weight: bold !important; text-decoration: underline;">
        <p>Sanitization & Disinfection</p>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-sparkles fa-2x tooltipped" style="color: #3CB371;" data-position="bottom" data-tooltip="Reducing germs through thorough surface sanitization."></i>
        <p class="narrow-paragraph">We help reduce germs and bacteria through thorough sanitization of high-touch surfaces.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col s12 m4" style="font-weight: bold !important; text-decoration: underline;">
        <p>Responsible Chemical Handling</p>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-pump-medical fa-2x tooltipped" style="color: #3CB371;" data-position="bottom" data-tooltip="Safe product use with attention to health and safety."></i>
        <p class="narrow-paragraph">All cleaning products are handled responsibly with safety and environmental awareness in mind.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container center-align" style="margin-top: 45px;">
      <p class="center-align teal-text text-lighten-1" style="margin-top: 35px; font-weight: bold;">
        We're Waiting To Hear From You
      </p>
      <a href="tel:+1-401-555-1125" class="btn">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i>&nbsp;Call Us
      </a>
      <p class="rateft center-align" style="font-size: 13px; max-width: 300px; margin: 20px auto 0; font-weight: bold;">
        Contact us now to schedule a cleaning date, get a quote, or speak to one of our associates. We're looking forward working with you soon.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<div></div>

<%- include('./partials/footer.ejs') %> 

<script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.0.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/materialize/1.0.0/js/materialize.min.js"></script> 

<%- include('./partials/scripts.ejs') %>
</body>
</html>
